##### Macro Path F-Net State-Transition RNN #####
##### Yield path: [x_{t-12}, ..., x_{t-1}] -> h_x,t #####
##### Macro path: [m_{t-12}, ..., m_{t-1}] -> h_m,t #####
##### Forecast head: [h_x,t, h_m,t] -> xr_t #####
##### Auxiliary state head: h_x,t -> x_hat_t #####
##### Two settings:
##### (1) single_no_val
##### (2) avg_val


